"Later, Aarl, Sarah, Stella and Khachi befriend Nathan Lark in Gemore and become the Heirs."
"Later, the Heirs swear an oath on the Gemore Seal to defend Gemore and defeat the Endings."
"Later, Aarl wins elemental sabers in the tomb of Sklias outside Gemore and uses them for years."
"Later, Aarl wins a size-changing club in Litcliff that seems once to have been Jaus's."
"Later, Stella's early flight spell drops Aarl a hundred feet onto rocks, and he survives."
"Later, Aarl works beside Giantsrest slave-elites in Halsmet, wearing armor with a deploying helm."
"Later, Aarl fights beside Nathan through the fall of Giantsrest."
"Years later, Brox trains Aarl in swordsmanship and teaches him to be \"unignorable.\""
"Years later, Aarl wields Brox's black-bladed sword, left to him after Badud kills Brox."
"He also wields an invisible ax that raises those it kills as zombies obeying him."
"Years later, in Esebus, Aarl cuts through Sussu's adamant vault wall with Brox's sword."
"In that fight Amoh douses him with acid, and Aarl bisects Amoh and bags the pieces."
"Aarl then takes the class Relicmaster, able to use nearly any item and identify items by touch."
"He wears Sussu's bracelets and swaps dozens of vault artifacts by thought."
"Aarl's Talent Spatial Blade later develops into Dimensional Reach, tripling his blades' reach."
"Aarl cooks for the Heirs and keeps track of their loot."
"In the Blight near Helmaris, Aarl loses a priceless mirrored kite shield to corruption."
"In a Questor war in Ostren, Aarl launches Nathan with a greatsword and kills a Quenfi swordsman."
"At the great Conclave, Aarl dies in a duel, is revived by Khachi's blessing, and kills Lyra Alys."
"By then Khachi has brought Aarl back from death three times."
"Nine years after the Conclave, Aarl trains Gemore's elite guard and leaves Jadya over his duties."
